 {\"events\":[...]} tracker-import envelope,\n  causing every request to silently import zero events (HTTP 200 but\n  stats.created=0). Wrap the formatted event object at call site.\n\nImportant:\n- Add jsonPath assertion on stats.created==1 to catch future payload\n  drift (renamed data element, wrong program/programStage UID, etc.)\n  from silently measuring nothing.\n- Add .exitHereIfFailed() after login() to prevent unauthenticated\n  requests from polluting response-time distributions if login fails.\n\nMinor:\n- Fix misleading javadoc claiming -Dprogram/-DprogramStage alone\n  enable testing a different program (data element UIDs are hardcoded).\n  Clarify that a new program needs a new PAYLOAD_TEMPLATE constant.\n- Add comment explaining hardcoded occurredAt (2026-08-02) and orgUnit\n  (DiszpKrYNg8) design choice.\n- Rename scenario \"Single event import\" -\u003e \"Single event program\" and\n  request \"Single event import\" -\u003e \"Import event\" to avoid HTML report\n  ambiguity.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"0967d749cb4a9ae98023452cfac6e29166948c2c","tree_id":"e6080325cb0b4ed2b1df3310ace631afc6bad522","timestamp":"2026-08-09T08:50:09Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/10954","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gi